[[3,10,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2889704\">A1</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2891739\">4450B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891587\">3310B50</a></p><p>1. Undo the fixing bolt (1a) and remove the rpm sensor (1b). Place\nto one side.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034897.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,10,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts fixing the disc shield to the wheel hub stub axle.</p><p>2. Remove the rear brake disc shield.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034898.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Position the rear brake disc\nshield and tighten the bolts fixing it to the wheel hub stub axle.</p><p>Place the rpm sensor in position and tighten\nthe retaining bolt.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891587\">3310B50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891739\">4450B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891661\">3380A04</a></p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2889704\">A1</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]